    "ACC1-ACC2 have a Max_Pres_Value of 65535; Scale, Prescale and Units are writable.",
    "RIBMNWD12-BCDI (PICS v2.15, same date, media MCQIAIDEZHPNDEDFKXCSELY733CM) has BI1-BI12 only."
